        "id": 1003571
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-25T21:29:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here you take the MIN of 1000 or max_groups_membership which has a max of INT32_MAX and defaults to 2000...\n\n\nLet\u0027s make the default and max in the config sensible, and drop this hidden default.",
      "revId": "b05afb4ad9cc0fd7bef7e01c504293205e392679",
